  result: 'penkra tabs snapshot\n' +
    'Capture the current accessibility snapshot of one exact retained App tab.\n' +
    '\n' +
    'How to use this operation\n' +
    '\n' +
    "References remain valid for the document's current loader and become stale after navigation. Choose d1 for the App document or d2 for its hosted page.\n" +
    '\n' +
    'Examples\n' +
    '\n' +
    '  Observe one retained tab\n' +
    '\n' +
    '  {\n' +
    '    "command": "penkra tabs snapshot --tab-id <tab-id> --document d1 --interactive true --compact true"\n' +
    '  }\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Input fields\n' +
    '  --document <string>  required; one of "d1", "d2". d1 addresses the App document; d2 addresses its hosted page, when present.\n' +
    '  --tab-id <string>  required. Exact retained App tab ID returned by penkra tabs list.\n' +
    '  --boxes <boolean>  optional.\n' +
    '  --compact <boolean>  optional.\n' +
    '  --depth <number>  optional.\n' +
    '  --filename <string>  optional.\n' +
    '  --interactive <boolean>  optional.\n' +
    '  --ref <string>  optional. Durable document reference returned by snapshot for the current loader.\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Invocation\n' +
    '  Send one ordinary command string. Pass each input field by name exactly as listed\n' +
    '  under Input fields (for example --thread-id <id>). A bare value without its --name\n' +
    '  is rejected. Use --input "{...}" to pass the complete input as one JSON value.\n' +
    '  --input   Complete JSON operation input validated against the schema below.\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Operating manual\n' +
    '  Run penkra tabs --help for Tabs operating instructions.\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Validated input schema\n' +
    '{\n' +
    '  "type": "object",\n' +
    '  "properties": {\n' +
    '    "tabId": {\n' +
    '      "type": "string",\n' +
    '      "minLength": 1,\n' +
    '      "description": "Exact retained App tab ID returned by penkra tabs list."\n' +
    '    },\n' +
    '    "document": {\n' +
    '      "type": "string",\n' +
    '      "enum": [\n' +
    '        "d1",\n' +
    '        "d2"\n' +
    '      ],\n' +
    '      "description": "d1 addresses the App document; d2 addresses its hosted page, when present."\n' +
    '    },\n' +
    '    "ref": {\n' +
    '      "type": "string",\n' +
    '      "pattern": "^d[12]:e[0-9]+$",\n' +
    '      "description": "Durable document reference returned by snapshot for the current loader."\n' +
    '    },\n' +
    '    "depth": {\n' +
    '      "type": "number",\n' +
    '      "minimum": 0\n' +
    '    },\n' +
    '    "boxes": {\n' +
    '      "type": "boolean"\n' +
    '    },\n' +
    '    "interactive": {\n' +
    '      "type": "boolean"\n' +
    '    },\n' +
    '    "compact": {\n' +
    '      "type": "boolean"\n' +
    '    },\n' +
    '    "filename": {\n' +
    '      "type": "string",\n' +
    '      "minLength": 1\n' +
    '    }\n' +
    '  },\n' +
    '  "required": [\n' +
    '    "tabId",\n' +
    '    "document"\n' +
    '  ],\n' +
    '  "additionalProperties": false\n' +
    '}\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Validated output schema\n' +
    '{\n' +
    '  "type": "object"\n' +
    '}\n'
}
